# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/

# custom
# OS built result
*.img
*.iso

*.log

# RFC-0.27-004: a QEMU serial log promoted into tests/evidence/ by
# `cargo xtask evidence promote` is the one kind of log this project commits
# — deliberately, never as a side effect of a routine run (D1). Narrow on
# purpose: this must not accidentally catch any other *.log anywhere else.
!tests/evidence/**

# RFC-0.27-004 R3 writes a per-run copy of each QEMU run's output to
# tests/qemu/artifacts/<profile>/runs/<run-id>/. serial.log was already covered
# by *.log above, but run-info.txt and qemu-command.txt are not, so every run
# left two untracked files behind and the release cycle's entry criterion 1
# ("git status --short is empty") could never hold again. Ignore the per-run
# directory only: the per-profile expected-markers.txt, qemu-command.txt and
# result-summary.txt one level up are tracked and must stay tracked.
tests/qemu/artifacts/*/runs/

# `cargo xtask test-all` writes one directory per run under tests/runs/, holding
# 21 per-tier *.log files (already covered above) plus summary.txt and
# summary.json, which are not. Those two are why every run leaves an untracked
# directory behind, and why `git add -A` swept 22 of them into 78d8ea3.
#
# CHANGELOG.md's v0.2.x entry has claimed since that release that this rule was
# added. It never was: `git log -S "tests/runs" -- .gitignore` returns nothing.
# Added for real 2026-09-09, and the 44 accidentally-committed files untracked
# in the same commit.
#
# tests/evidence/ is the place a run's output is kept deliberately
# (RFC-0.27-004); tests/runs/ is not, and never was.
tests/runs/

# Verus proof compilation output (rlib written to CWD by the verus binary)
**/lib*.rlib

# Custom
/.git-exclude/
*.local.json
